    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The EDD Geckoboard extension provides near-realtime stats regarding your EDD website through the Geckoboard KPI dashboard platform. Currently, the extension supports the following widgets:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sales (Bar/Column Graph &amp; Number Widgets)</li>\n<li>Extensions (Bar/Column Graph &amp; Number Widgets)</li>\n<li>Recent Purchases (List Widget)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Follow this plugin on <a href=\"https://github.com/Section214/EDD-Geckoboard\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GitHub</a></strong></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Activate the plugin</li>\n<li>Go to your profile page to get the API endpoints for Geckoboard</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>Version 1.0.1, February 3, 2026</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated: Author to DigitalME</li>\n<li>Updated: Contributor to ympno</li>\n<li>Tested up to WordPress 6.9</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Version 1.0.0, February 13, 2016</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release!</li>\n</ul>\n"
